<title>USA: IXC Comms gets $31 mln in contracts.</title>
<headline>IXC Comms gets $31 mln in contracts.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>IXC Communications Inc said on Tuesday that it signed 14 contracts in August worth an estimated total of $31 million.</p>
<p>The nine contracts represent commitments for reseller long distance and high-speed digital bandwidth services, the company said.</p>
</text>
